```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "osi-layer-runner", title: "OSI Layer Runner", seed: "osi-layer-01",
  theme: { preset: "neon" },

  learning: {
    subject: "Jaringan Komputer",
    concept: "Perangkat jaringan diklasifikasikan berdasarkan lapisan model OSI: Fisik, Data Link, dan Network",
    objectives: ["Mengelompokkan perangkat jaringan ke lapisan OSI yang tepat"],
    misconceptions: ["Switch dan hub dianggap sama saja"],
    mode: "category",
    categories: [
      { id: "fisik",     label: "Fisik",     color: "#00E5FF" },
      { id: "data-link", label: "Data Link", color: "#FF3DCB" },
      { id: "network",   label: "Network",   color: "#B388FF" }
    ],
    items: [
      { id: "kabel-utp",   label: "Kabel UTP",     category: "fisik",     explain: "Media transmisi sinyal listrik; bekerja di lapisan Fisik." },
      { id: "hub",         label: "Hub",           category: "fisik",     explain: "Meneruskan sinyal ke semua port tanpa melihat alamat; lapisan Fisik." },
      { id: "repeater",    label: "Repeater",      category: "fisik",     explain: "Memperkuat dan mengulang sinyal; bekerja di lapisan Fisik." },
      { id: "switch",      label: "Switch",        category: "data-link", explain: "Meneruskan frame berdasarkan alamat MAC; lapisan Data Link." },
      { id: "bridge",      label: "Bridge",        category: "data-link", explain: "Menghubungkan segmen jaringan dengan alamat MAC; lapisan Data Link." },
      { id: "nic",         label: "Kartu Jaringan", category: "data-link", explain: "NIC punya alamat MAC unik; bekerja di lapisan Data Link." },
      { id: "router",      label: "Router",        category: "network",   explain: "Meneruskan paket berdasarkan alamat IP; lapisan Network." },
      { id: "switch-l3",   label: "Switch Layer-3", category: "network",  explain: "Bisa melakukan routing antar jaringan; bekerja di lapisan Network." },
      { id: "gateway",     label: "Gateway",       category: "network",   explain: "Menghubungkan jaringan berbeda protokol; lapisan Network." }
    ],
    target: { rotateAfterCorrect: 5, bias: 0.5 }
  },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 3, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 360, maxSpeed: 720, accel: 6 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "kabel-kusut", w: 44, h: 48, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "server-rusak", w: 90, h: 24, weight: 2 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: true },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 8 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 15, speed: 25 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

**OSI Layer Runner** adalah game Endless Runner edukasi bertema Neon di mana pemain mengambil perangkat jaringan yang cocok dengan lapisan OSI target (Fisik, Data Link, Network). Asumsi penting: rintangan berupa "kabel kusut" dan "server rusak" dipakai sebagai penghalang generik karena engine belum mendukung rintangan berbentuk perangkat spesifik.
